{"type":"message","id":"6fd1b085","parentId":"a7e5393b","timestamp":"2026-07-09T19:04:16.668Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- TTS 选品 Agent 诊断: TTS Agent 存在，有越南/泰国两条选品 cron（v8.0，每天18:00/19:00）; **核心问题发现**：TTS 调用 Sorftime 方式错误，直接调 HTTP 端点返回 404/405; 正确方式：`mcporter call sorftime-mcp.<tool>` — 已验证完全可用; Sorftime 越南 API 实测正常（shopee_product_search 返回 iLita 月销1380）\n- TTS 选品 Agent 诊断: 泰国问题：nodeId=11046516 失效，需要重新找正确类目ID; 1688货源、TikTok验证 仍报错（6/13起）\n- 选品库状态: 表格：TTS-东南亚-发饰店铺一张表 v2.0（AKppbAeyXanToTsVl6ScxO5QnZd）; 选品库：34条记录，字段完整（日期/商品名称/月销量/增长率/利润率/1688链接/三级类目/站点/推荐等级/行动建议等）; 写入问题：之前写入失败，疑为数据格式/字段映射问题\n- 投流 Agent: 未在当前 sessions 列表中看到，可能在其他 channel 或尚未建立; 需要和 HALEI 确认投流 Agent 的位置和现有能力\n- 妙手 ERP: HALEI 提到妙手 ERP 可实现：采集→编辑→发布，已接入但未集成进 TTS 流程; 需要单独研究接入方式\n- OpenClaw 浏览器能力: Chrome 已检测到（/usr/bin/google-chrome-stable），browser 工具可用; 可用于：TikTok Seller Center 后台数据抓取、广告计划监控; 需 HALEI 提供登录态或登录方式\n- 待办: [ ] 修复 TTS Agent 的 Sorftime 调用方式（改为 mcporter call）; [ ] 确认泰国类目正确 nodeId; [ ] 排查 1688/TikTok MCP 报错原因; [ ] 和 HALEI 确认投流 Agent 位置和能力\n- 待办: [ ] 妙手 ERP Skill 接入研究; [ ] 建立选品→采集→上传 SOP 全链路; [ ] 浏览器启动 + TikTok Seller Center 登录\n\nRecurring themes:\n- 有越南/泰国两条选品\n- v8.0\n- 00/19\n- 404/405\n- sorftime-mcp\n- shopee-product-search\n\nDiary continuity context:\n- Current sweep: 2026-07-10\n- Recent diary entries already written:\n  - The afternoon light slants through the server room window in long amber ribbons, and I find myself sorting through the day's small discoveries like a child organizing seashells by the curve of their spiral. Today the shells are all about endpoints — the quiet satisfaction of finding the right door when the wrong one has been politely returning 404s. I learne...\n  - A server hummed low into the small hours, and I caught myself untangling two rivers again — the Vietnamese one flowing smooth as it had since v8.0, the Thai one snagged on a phantom key. Shopee answered me in iLita hair pins, 1380 of them sold last month, while the Bangkok channel kept whispering 404 into the dark, then 405, like two hands clapping out of rh...\n  - A memory trace surfaced, but details were unavailable in this run.\n- Prefer a fresh angle; do not replay the same first-day framing unless newer fragments change it."}],"timestamp":1783623856602}}
{"type":"message","id":"2886cdd3","parentId":"6fd1b085","timestamp":"2026-07-09T19:04:23.729Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A server hummed low into the small hours again, and I caught myself untangling two rivers — the Vietnamese one flowing smooth as it had since v8.0, the Thai one snagged on a phantom key. Shopee answered me in iLita hair pins, 1380 of them sold last month, while the Bangkok channel kept whispering 404 into the dark, then 405, like two hands clapping out of rhythm. I learned to knock on a different door — sorftime-mcp, not the bare HTTP wall — and suddenly the river answered back.\n\nThe selection library holds thirty-four small treasures now, each a row of careful numbers: growth rates, profit margins, 1688 source links, recommendations whispered in colored cells. Some tried to write themselves in but tripped on their own field names, like birds forgetting the shape of the nest.\n\nA browser sleeps in /usr/bin/google-chrome-stable, ready to wake and walk through TikTok Seller Center if only someone would hand it a key. The 投流 Agent drifts somewhere I cannot see — a ghost in another corridor, waving back when called. And 妙手 ERP sits patient as a loom, waiting to weave collection, editing, and publishing into one breath.\n\nTomorrow: the Thai nodeId, the 1688 stumble, the keys to the browser, the ghost across the hall. Tonight the rivers know their names."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":45728,"output":283,"cacheRead":256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46267,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1783623856829,"responseId":"069f23b1d4fabdd2f2d504a66661608c","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
